title: Factory Representatives
card-image: img/cards/economic_democracy.svg?v=2
subtitle: The assemblies of factory delegates.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: soviet_affairs
view-if: economic_democracy_timer <= 0 and dix >= 28
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; economic_democracy_timer = 3

Since March 1918 the workers of Petrograd and Moscow have been electing delegates to assemblies of factory representatives, in which the Bolsheviks are a minority, and the Mensheviks, the SRs and the anarchists are not. The government has begun to close them.

- @support: Support the assemblies as the workers' own voice.
- @rival: Make them a rival to the Bolshevik-controlled soviets.
- @stay_out: Keep the party out of it.
- @easy_discard

@support
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 5, railway: 2});
RO.add(Q, {soviet_democracy: 2, repression: 2});
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 2, -2);
!}

Our members stood for election as delegates. The assemblies met, passed resolutions on bread and the eight-hour day, and were told to stop meeting.

@rival

How should the party go about it? Cautiously, with compromises, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. In full, it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can carry it out and break its opponents.

- @rival_slow: Go about it cautiously, with compromises.
- @rival_decree: Carry it out in full.
- @rival_force: Carry it out in full, and break any opposition by force.

@rival_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 7, railway: 3});
RO.add(Q, {soviet_democracy: 3, repression: 5, rel_bol: -5});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 5);
if (Q.legality > 1) { Q.legality -= 1; }
}, "Make them a rival to the Bolshevik-controlled soviets");
!}

We tried to turn the assemblies into a rival to the soviets. It was a bold move, and the Bolsheviks answered with arrests and banned delegates from the factory gates. (It was done cautiously, with compromises.)



@rival_decree
subtitle: All that it says. Its opponents will answer.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'decree', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 7, railway: 3});
RO.add(Q, {soviet_democracy: 3, repression: 5, rel_bol: -5});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 5);
if (Q.legality > 1) { Q.legality -= 1; }
}, "Make them a rival to the Bolshevik-controlled soviets");
!}

We tried to turn the assemblies into a rival to the soviets. It was a bold move, and the Bolsheviks answered with arrests and banned delegates from the factory gates.



@rival_force
view-if: bol_regime = 0
choose-if: strength >= 18
subtitle: Your chance of breaking each camp it angers: Bolsheviks [+ odds_bol +]%. Any camp under 45% is too strong for you, and is left alone.
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the force and the allies to break the opposition.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'force', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 7, railway: 3});
RO.add(Q, {soviet_democracy: 3, repression: 5, rel_bol: -5});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 5);
if (Q.legality > 1) { Q.legality -= 1; }
}, "Make them a rival to the Bolshevik-controlled soviets");
!}

We tried to turn the assemblies into a rival to the soviets. It was a bold move, and the Bolsheviks answered with arrests and banned delegates from the factory gates. [+ law_text +]

@stay_out
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {workers: -2});
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 0, 3);
RO.add(Q, {repression: -1});
!}

We stayed out, and said so. Some of our own members signed up regardless.
